### 3 & 4. `AkFileSyncEvent.Failed` / `BkFileSyncEvent.Failed` —— **厂商 SDK 定义**，`code` 字段就是上面同一个枚举（**没有单独的 sync 专属错误码类型**）：

```
public final class com.wakeup.sdk.ble.akwglasses.AkFileSyncEvent$Failed extends com.wakeup.sdk.ble.akwglasses.AkFileSyncEvent {
  private final com.wakeup.sdk.ble.akwglasses.AkGlassesErrorCode code;
  private final java.lang.String message;
  ...
}

public final class com.wakeup.sdk.ble.bkglasses.BkFileSyncEvent$Failed extends com.wakeup.sdk.ble.bkglasses.BkFileSyncEvent {
  private final com.wakeup.sdk.ble.bkglasses.BkGlassesErrorCode code;
  private final java.lang.String message;
  ...
}
```
即 `AkFileSyncEvent.Failed.code: AkGlassesErrorCode`（case 列表同第 1 项），`BkFileSyncEvent.Failed.code: BkGlassesErrorCode`（case 列表同第 2 项）。

调用侧（本仓库源码，仅确认字段读取方式，不是定义）：

```407:413:packages/core/core_device_native_runtime/android/src/main/kotlin/com/smartdevice/platform/core_device_native_runtime/file_transfer/CoreDeviceFileTransferPlugin.kt
        // Same "sdk_<code>" convention already used for AkFileSyncEvent.Failed/
        // BkFileSyncEvent.Failed below — the vendor SDK's count()/queryRemoteFileCount()
        // throws this directly (e.g. HotspotJoinFailed/FtpConnectFailed/DeviceNetworkNotReady)
        // instead of emitting a sync event, so it needs its own case here or it silently
        // collapses into the generic summary_failed/start_failed fallback.
        is AkGlassesException -> FlutterError("media_transfer.sdk_${error.code.name.lowercase()}", error.message, null)
        is BkGlassesException -> FlutterError("media_transfer.sdk_${error.code.name.lowercase()}", error.message, null)
```

### 5. `NativeOtaEvent.Failed` —— **我们自己 runtime 定义**（不是厂商类型）
`code` 字段类型是 **`String`**（不是枚举），源码原文：

```357:361:packages/core/core_device_native_runtime/android/src/main/kotlin/com/smartdevice/platform/core_device_native_runtime/ota_transfer/CoreDeviceOtaTransferPlugin.kt
    private sealed interface NativeOtaEvent {
        data class StageChanged(val stage: DeviceOtaTransferStageMessage, val percent: Int) : NativeOtaEvent
        data class Progress(val percent: Int, val sentBytes: Long, val totalBytes: Long) : NativeOtaEvent
        data object Completed : NativeOtaEvent
        data class Failed(val code: String, val message: String?) : NativeOtaEvent
    }
```

它是把厂商 `AkOtaEvent.Failed` / `BkOtaEvent.Failed` 的枚举 `code` 通过 `.name` 转成字符串塞进来的：

```414:418:packages/core/core_device_native_runtime/android/src/main/kotlin/com/smartdevice/platform/core_device_native_runtime/ota_transfer/CoreDeviceOtaTransferPlugin.kt
        private fun AkOtaEvent.toNative(): NativeOtaEvent = when (this) {
            is AkOtaEvent.StageChanged -> NativeOtaEvent.StageChanged(stage.toBridge(), percent)
            is AkOtaEvent.Progress -> NativeOtaEvent.Progress(percent, sentBytes, totalBytes)
            is AkOtaEvent.Completed -> NativeOtaEvent.Completed
            is AkOtaEvent.Failed -> NativeOtaEvent.Failed(code.name, message)
        }
```

（注：`AkOtaEvent.Failed`/`BkOtaEvent.Failed` 各自的 `code` 也是 `AkGlassesErrorCode`/`BkGlassesErrorCode`，本次未展开反编译 —— 若你重写 OTA 映射需要它俩的 case 列表，其实就是第 1/2 项同一个枚举，因为 AAR 里所有 Ak*/Bk* 相关的错误码都复用这一个枚举类型。）

