## iOS

### 6. `AkGlassesProviderError` —— **厂商 SDK 定义**
完整路径：`packages/core/core_device_native_runtime/ios/vendor/WeikeBLEAKWGlasses/Sources/WeikeBLEAKWGlasses/AkGlassesModels.swift`（该路径下是符号链接，指向 `SDK/IOS/swift-package/sources` 里的真实源码，但内容一致）：

```241:262:packages/core/core_device_native_runtime/ios/vendor/WeikeBLEAKWGlasses/Sources/WeikeBLEAKWGlasses/AkGlassesModels.swift
public enum AkGlassesErrorCode: Sendable {
    case bluetoothNotConnected
    case locationNotGranted
    case localNetworkNotGranted
    case hotspotJoinCancelled
    case hotspotJoinFailed
    case nearbyWifiDevicesNotGranted
    case deviceNetworkNotReady
    case ftpConnectFailed
    case ftpTransferFailed
