### 8. iOS `AkFileSyncEvent`/`BkFileSyncEvent` 的 `.failed(code, message)` —— **厂商 SDK 定义**，`code` 同样是上面这两个枚举（Ak/Bk 各自的 `*GlassesErrorCode`），没有独立的 sync 专属类型：

```67:73:packages/core/core_device_native_runtime/ios/vendor/WeikeBLEAKWGlasses/Sources/WeikeBLEAKWGlasses/AkGlassesModels.swift
public enum AkFileSyncEvent: Equatable, Sendable {
    case started(totalCount: Int?)
    case progress(index: Int, totalCount: Int?, percent: Int, fileName: String)
    case fileCompleted(index: Int, localPath: String, sizeBytes: Int64)
    case completed
    case failed(code: AkGlassesErrorCode, message: String?)
}
```

```160:166:packages/core/core_device_native_runtime/ios/vendor/WeikeBLEBKGlasses/Sources/WeikeBLEBKGlasses/BkGlassesModels.swift
public enum BkFileSyncEvent: Equatable, Sendable {
    case started(totalCount: Int?)
    case progress(index: Int, totalCount: Int?, percent: Int, fileName: String)
    case fileCompleted(index: Int, localPath: String, sizeBytes: Int64)
    case completed
    case failed(code: BkGlassesErrorCode, message: String?)
